{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"duration","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customError","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP","text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")? = nil) -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV","text":"Timeout","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency15SuspendingClockV","text":"SuspendingClock","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The longest the sequence may go without an element.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"duration"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The error to throw when the timer fires. Defaults to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError.timedOut(duration:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"customError"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the same elements that throws if the upstream goes quiet."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The timer starts when iteration begins and restarts with every element, so it bounds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wait for the first element and each gap after it, never the sequence as a whole. Elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass through unchanged. When the timer fires, the upstream is cancelled and the sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws before the first element."}]},{"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["for try await event in serverEvents.timeout(.seconds(30)) {","    handle(event)","}","\/\/ Throws TimeoutError.timedOut if 30 seconds pass without an event"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customError"},{"text":") when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"duration"},{"text":" passes between elements, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any error the upstream throws.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Throws","type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Fails if the sequence goes the given duration without producing an element, measured on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SuspendingClock"},{"text":".","type"